{"server":"tw","storyId":"act42side_level_act42side_05_beg","groupId":"act42side","stageId":"act42side_05","title":"共融","storyCode":"MT-5","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act42side/level_act42side_05_beg.txt","sourceHash":"eaa430de48a99e28d84d717f0d8d00662e21a882ae3744d5c074c9ff49d45d31","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"49_g2_kazdelstreet_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲工人A","speakerId":"avg_npc_932_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，你趕著投胎啊？走這麼快！我們抬的是一塊源石結晶板啊，等一下摔壞就都死翹翹了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲工人A","speakerId":"avg_npc_932_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這家人也真是的，用這種東西壓泡菜，也不怕吃進嘴裡的都是源石顆粒！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲工人B","speakerId":"avg_npc_933_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別*薩卡茲粗口*囉囉嗦嗦了，快點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲工人B","speakerId":"avg_npc_933_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今天之內清理完這個城區，這個任務不簡單，你也不想老大被那個老巫妖罵得臭血淋頭後再把我們罵得臭血淋頭吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲工人A","speakerId":"avg_npc_932_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這麼多間屋子，要把沾到源石的地方都清理乾淨……巴別塔都組建了專門的城建隊，為什麼不乾脆把它們推倒了重蓋？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲工人A","speakerId":"avg_npc_932_1","isRemote":false,"text":"話說回來，想到接下來哪裡都看不見源石，還真的有點不適應。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲工人B","speakerId":"avg_npc_933_1","isRemote":false,"text":"閉上你那張臭嘴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲工人B","speakerId":"avg_npc_933_1","isRemote":false,"text":"以前是沒辦法，只有靠著礦脈的產出才能過活，現在卡茲戴爾已經不用再為能源苦惱了，當然要把屋子打掃乾淨……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲工人B","speakerId":"avg_npc_933_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你還真喜歡住在源石窩裡啊——喂，巫妖，看路！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲工人A","speakerId":"avg_npc_932_1","isRemote":false,"text":"巫妖，收好你的線頭，鬼知道你們那些線和源石打結之後，會惹出什麼麻煩……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這樣說話很不禮貌哦。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃芒加德","speakerId":"avg_npc_869_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是纏住了，就用你們的角幫我勾斷吧。不過那樣的話，我的絲弦會不會把你們拖進別的空間裡去呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲工人們","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃芒加德","speakerId":"avg_npc_869_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好啦，不嚇你們了。先生們，請過去吧~"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲工人A","speakerId":"avg_npc_932_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，是我眼花了嗎？剛剛的光線是怎麼回事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲工人B","speakerId":"avg_npc_933_1","isRemote":false,"text":"前面的房子？過去看看。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃芒加德","speakerId":"avg_npc_869_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……讓我去吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲工人A","speakerId":"avg_npc_932_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃芒加德","speakerId":"avg_npc_869_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那排房子緊貼著剛整合完畢的農田地塊，剛剛的光，應該是監測土壤的信標感應到了你們兩個搬的源石結晶板。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃芒加德","speakerId":"avg_npc_869_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是維什戴爾知道這兩年好不容易開墾的農田被污染……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲工人B","speakerId":"avg_npc_933_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走吧走吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"49_g1_kazdelroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞西莉亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不、不要再往前了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾澤爾","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"埃芒加德看著面前緊張的小女孩，她嘗試用自己小小的身軀擋住來人的視線。\n女孩身後，薩科塔男性脫力般跪在地板上，他的光環與光翼支離破碎，那些碎片像是活物般顫抖著，忽明忽暗，彷彿故障的燈。\n而薩科塔本人如同墮入了深深的夢中，不發一言。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞西莉亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是誰？你是來抓我們的嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"小女孩很緊張，埃芒加德彎下腰，用手撐著膝蓋，儘量讓自己看起來沒有敵意，她甚至搖了搖自己充盈著能量的大尾巴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃芒加德","speakerId":"avg_npc_869_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可愛的小妹妹，我沒有惡意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃芒加德","speakerId":"avg_npc_869_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你剛剛應該聽到了，我支開了其他的薩卡茲。或許我能幫你們……幫他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞西莉亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"埃芒加德關緊了身後的門，將可能的視線隔絕在外。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"她將自己的帽子扶正，看不見的絲弦逶迤向不可知的空間。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃芒加德","speakerId":"avg_npc_869_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老師。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弗萊蒙特","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"雖然高塔上那些繁文縟節和廢話連篇的經卷真的倒人胃口，但對比現在，我真的得向那對雙子羊鞠躬，感謝她們的禮遇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弗萊蒙特","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"誰受得了每項政策都只能口頭傳達而且動不動還得翻來覆去解釋好幾遍，什麼時候才能對我們的公務員進行普及教育……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃芒加德","speakerId":"avg_npc_869_1","isRemote":false,"text":"急事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弗萊蒙特","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……說。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃芒加德","speakerId":"avg_npc_869_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在節點爐這邊發現了兩個光環破碎的薩科塔……其中一個狀態非常非常，不對勁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弗萊蒙特","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弗萊蒙特","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"帶他們回來，儘量別讓其他人注意到，免得引起騷亂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弗萊蒙特","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我去把維什戴爾踹醒。到了需要這個議長主持緊急會議的時候了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"44_g6_towerterrace"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊維格娜德","speakerId":"avg_npc_487_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……真是一份很長的名單啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊維格娜德","speakerId":"avg_npc_487_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也就是說，就職於崔林特爾梅各個高塔的四十三名薩科塔，未經任何允許，全部擅自脫離了自己的崗位。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米夏埃爾","speakerId":"avg_4109_baslin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，伊維格娜德。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米夏埃爾","speakerId":"avg_4109_baslin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們硬是突破了厄登赫爾大區入境檢查的哨站，已經離開了萊塔尼亞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊維格娜德","speakerId":"avg_npc_487_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萊塔尼亞無私地收容了這些離群者，然而他們如今卻選擇叛逃了……毫無徵兆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米夏埃爾","speakerId":"avg_4109_baslin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"倒也不能說毫無徵兆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米夏埃爾","speakerId":"avg_4109_baslin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"帝國音樂學院的守夜人目擊到一位薩科塔學者離開了，他的光環和光翼都已經破碎……像是發生了很嚴重的意外。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊維格娜德","speakerId":"avg_npc_487_1","isRemote":false,"text":"墮天？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米夏埃爾","speakerId":"avg_4109_baslin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……不完全像。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊維格娜德","speakerId":"avg_npc_487_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你認為應該如何處理呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米夏埃爾","speakerId":"avg_4109_baslin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您——您在問我的意見？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊維格娜德","speakerId":"avg_npc_487_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊維格娜德","speakerId":"avg_npc_487_1","isRemote":false,"text":"米夏埃爾·沃爾夫岡，你現在是“無情權威”的代言人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊維格娜德","speakerId":"avg_npc_487_1","isRemote":false,"text":"除了我以外，你是她留在世間唯一的聲音。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米夏埃爾","speakerId":"avg_4109_baslin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊維格娜德","speakerId":"avg_npc_487_1","isRemote":false,"text":"和幾年前比起來，你的個子長高了一些，心境成長了不少，希爾德加德把你教得很好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊維格娜德","speakerId":"avg_npc_487_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你今天能站在這裡向我彙報所有的情報，值得讚譽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊維格娜德","speakerId":"avg_npc_487_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這代表你向我坦白了自己有一些特別的管道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米夏埃爾","speakerId":"avg_4109_baslin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萊塔尼亞的薩科塔集體“墮天”並叛逃，茲事體大……伊維格娜德，您是唯一有能力處理此事的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊維格娜德","speakerId":"avg_npc_487_1","isRemote":false,"text":"作為獎勵，我也不介意你、烏提卡的那個孩子，甚至那個小伯爵私底下的一些動作。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米夏埃爾","speakerId":"avg_4109_baslin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊維格娜德","speakerId":"avg_npc_487_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，讓我們言歸正傳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米夏埃爾","speakerId":"avg_4109_baslin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"入境檢查隊的報告中說，他們離去的方向，應該是拉特蘭。這次叛逃事件極可能有拉特蘭官方參與其中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米夏埃爾","speakerId":"avg_4109_baslin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是否需要派遣女皇之聲，向教皇廳討個說法？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊維格娜德","speakerId":"avg_npc_487_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一年前，伊萬杰利斯塔十一世曾在女皇慶典之後與我聯絡，他請求與萊塔尼亞攜手並進。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊維格娜德","speakerId":"avg_npc_487_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這群薩科塔如今的種種異常，或許說明，那場讓教宗深為忌憚、不得不主動向我們尋求幫助的“災異”，已經降臨了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊維格娜德","speakerId":"avg_npc_487_1","isRemote":false,"text":"向所有高塔發出詔令，召集最優秀的術師與學者……以“永恆恩典”與“無情權威”共同的名義。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊維格娜德","speakerId":"avg_npc_487_1","isRemote":false,"text":"災難不會對這片大地的任何一處留私，我們需要儘快解讀那自混沌中取來的秘密。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米夏埃爾","speakerId":"avg_4109_baslin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米夏埃爾","speakerId":"avg_4109_baslin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我馬上去安排。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊維格娜德","speakerId":"avg_npc_487_1","isRemote":false,"text":"倒不用這麼急。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米夏埃爾","speakerId":"avg_4109_baslin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我、我的意思是，我去知會女皇之聲，讓她們去……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊維格娜德","speakerId":"avg_npc_487_1","isRemote":false,"text":"米夏埃爾，今天的晚霞也很美麗啊，陪我看看吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊維格娜德","speakerId":"avg_npc_487_1","isRemote":false,"text":"天空的傷口早已癒合……她也會喜歡現在的夜晚，對吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米夏埃爾","speakerId":"avg_4109_baslin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_campsite_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧羅拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1782_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帳篷裡的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……拉烏尼達東邊的東邊，白色的聖城，拉特蘭♪"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帳篷裡的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那裡的銃炮放出煙火，那裡的靶子都是蘋果♪"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帳篷裡的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"當我們誠心祈禱，祂便給予麵包♪"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帳篷裡的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"當我們向祂奔去，祂便賜予救贖♪"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧羅拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1782_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唱吧，唱到睡著。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧羅拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1782_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們夢裡的神可是比拉特蘭的主還要仁慈。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"努艾達","speakerId":"avg_4187_graceb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"守夜不需要跑這麼遠，奧羅拉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧羅拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1782_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……滾開。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧羅拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1782_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡已經是米諾斯的地界，辛嘉斯的那幫貴族佬不會再追過來，你們安全了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧羅拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1782_1","isRemote":false,"text":"修道院已經不復存在了，各奔東西吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"努艾達","speakerId":"avg_4187_graceb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"十年前，你一聲不吭地來到我的修道院，幫我把地塊從那幫貴族手裡保下來，如今你要離開，又是一聲不吭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧羅拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1782_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你佈你的道，我幫你保護那些孩子，換個落腳的地方，順便而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧羅拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1782_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別把自己看得太重要了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"努艾達","speakerId":"avg_4187_graceb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"奧羅拉……你不能離開。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"努艾達","speakerId":"avg_4187_graceb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"奧羅拉，我不是在請求你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"努艾達","speakerId":"avg_4187_graceb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們接下來的目的地相同，我們會與你結伴而行，一同前往拉特蘭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧羅拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1782_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我什麼時候說過，回拉特蘭要帶著你們？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"努艾達","speakerId":"avg_4187_graceb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們在一起十年了，奧羅拉。對羽蛇來說，這是很長很長的一段時光。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"努艾達","speakerId":"avg_4187_graceb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我或許確實沒有那麼相信拉特蘭，但我總該相信你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"努艾達","speakerId":"avg_4187_graceb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拉特蘭剝奪了你的公民身分，你無數次在我唱詩時咒罵那座城市……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"努艾達","speakerId":"avg_4187_graceb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但看看你自己，哪怕你已經在玻利瓦爾待了那麼久，卻還是不肯脫下這套銃騎的甲胄……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"努艾達","speakerId":"avg_4187_graceb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哪怕你已經成為墮天使，無法再使用守護銃，卻依然想盡辦法取得了這架黑鋼的銃械，你從來都沒有——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧羅拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1782_1","isRemote":false,"text":"閉嘴。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"墮天使突然將武器往前送，漆黑的銃管幾乎抵在了羽蛇的唇邊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧羅拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1782_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你要是相信我，就該記得我告訴過你很多次，那座聖城沒那麼友愛，沒那麼仁慈和寬容……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧羅拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1782_1","isRemote":false,"text":"從修道院跟著你走到這裡的人，有一半都不是薩科塔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧羅拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1782_1","isRemote":false,"text":"離開玻利瓦爾後，你們有的是活路可找。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"努艾達","speakerId":"avg_4187_graceb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們信的或許不是拉特蘭真正的教條，但我們是憑著這個信仰，才得以在玻利瓦爾那樣混亂的地方勉強維持住還算有序的生活。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"努艾達","speakerId":"avg_4187_graceb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒辦法說服大家離開玻利瓦爾後，不去朝聖……而是去其他地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"努艾達","speakerId":"avg_4187_graceb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"同樣，我也沒辦法說服我自己。歷經漫長的歲月，拉特蘭已經是我們的一部分了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧羅拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1782_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在講笑話嗎……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"努艾達","speakerId":"avg_4187_graceb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"想想修道院裡的薩科塔，他們不在拉特蘭長大，莫名其妙墮天後，身心受到重創……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"努艾達","speakerId":"avg_4187_graceb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只有回到拉特蘭，才能知道發生了什麼，才能消除他們的恐慌，治好他們的“病”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"努艾達","speakerId":"avg_4187_graceb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"讓我們再同行最後一段路吧，奧羅拉。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧羅拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1782_1","isRemote":false,"text":"努艾達，我回拉特蘭，完全不是因為思鄉情切。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧羅拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1782_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道嗎？十年前，也是在一座修道院，有個老頭對我說過類似的話，他曾代表拉特蘭將我驅逐，就因為一些可笑的過錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧羅拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1782_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他渴望從我嘴裡聽到一些懺悔、一些祈求。他告訴我，如果能夠誠心懺悔，或許還有回去的機會……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"努艾達","speakerId":"avg_4187_graceb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你拒絕了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧羅拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1782_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我拒絕了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧羅拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1782_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那座城市想必出了不小的事，我回去，是要趁亂報復的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"努艾達抬頭迎上冰冷的銃管，將它貼在臉側。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"努艾達","speakerId":"avg_4187_graceb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放心，我們不會妨礙你的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"努艾達","speakerId":"avg_4187_graceb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們只是需要一個領路人，一個知曉前方路途、能判明方向的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"努艾達","speakerId":"avg_4187_graceb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一個像你一樣的人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"遠處帳篷裡的唱詩聲漸弱，孩子們呼喚的聲音三三兩兩地響起。\n奧羅拉嗤笑一聲，將銃收起。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"61_g9_catastrophicalley"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"育嬰聖堂在周圍的建築上塗抹出色彩，像是開啟了一扇扇門，頭頂光環的奇特生物從門後析出，一個接著一個降落至地面。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"除了那隻木攀獸的幼獸，這些傢伙，也得到了拉特蘭的賜福？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒙恩的生物A","speakerId":"avg_npc_1791_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（激動地拍掌）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒙恩的生物B","speakerId":"avg_npc_1792_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（不安地搖晃）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"牠們匍匐在地，奮力向上搖晃著腦袋，似乎還不太適應頭頂的光環。牠們的喉頭發出低沉而有規律的聲響，連綴成一片，猶如禱告。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，真是混沌的心聲，難聽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果基於某種暫不明確的原因，聖城中的所有人此前都深陷於某種巨大的群體性幻覺中……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼眼前的景象，是否代表，真實與虛幻的界限被模糊了，實際的災難正在入侵拉特蘭？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這比你我在帕維永中的經歷更加難以理解。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"費迪，有隻傢伙已經注意到我們了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒙恩的生物A","speakerId":"avg_npc_1791_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（禱告聲）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們發出的雜音，似乎驚擾了牠們的儀式。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"彷彿是因為沒有聽見禱告聲，一隻蒙恩的生物扭頭看向了費德里科與阿爾圖羅。\n牠的光環閃爍，臃腫的身軀似乎也變得輕盈，以極快的速度向兩人靠近。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"費德里科舉起銃，但頭頂光環的生物對此視若無睹，牠們的禱告聲不曾有一刻停歇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"退後。這些物種的來歷與屬性尚不明確，別陷入包圍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我還以為你會毫不猶豫地射擊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"費迪，你說，這些傢伙算是你我的同胞嗎？如果你現在開火，是否會觸犯律法？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是玩笑，還是不合時宜的提問？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的守護銃早已遺失，而我不需要開火也能制伏這些生物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"牠們是否被算作同胞，雖有查明的必要，但並不是目前的優先事項。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或許，有一個人能解開我們的所有困惑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……教宗，伊萬杰利斯塔十一世。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
